{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2025-09/1060677/block/singleImage/3250654/wm/Waterfall_Bay_HK.jpg?updatedAt=1793155159\"/><figcaption>香港仔瀑布灣道一石灘有一名男子在岸邊漂浮(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>香港仔瀑布灣道一石灘，周二（27日）下午3時許，警方接獲途人報案，指發現有一名男子在岸邊漂浮。警方消防接報到場，當場證實男子死亡。經調查死者80歲姓梁，其死因有待調查，案件被列作屍體發現跟進。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:42:08.290473+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":123,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T02:03:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T21:18:06.646024+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T03:38:20.707355+00:00","content_hash":"953e397138b0acedfeb86234bd094378c77bbece1e7f70054fdb93bb888db6aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-28T03:42:08.290473+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}